{"title": "Wounding Ray", "pageid": 8887, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Wounding_Ray", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Constitution saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Necrotic damage", "Unique Spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp/300px-Generic_Necrotic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Generic_Necrotic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Wounding Ray </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 necromancy spell</a>. It is a spell granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Spectator_Eyes\" title=\"The Spectator Eyes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Spectator_Eyes\" title=\"The Spectator Eyes\">The Spectator Eyes</a> which allows the user to shoot a deadly necrotic beam.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nShoot an eye ray that deals immense damage.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 2~16</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/D8_Necrotic.png/26px-D8_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/D8_Necrotic.png/40px-D8_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/D8_Necrotic.png/53px-D8_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/D8_Necrotic.png/26px-D8_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/D8_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d8</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving 